{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当乌西雅、约坦、亚哈斯、希西家作犹大王，约阿施的儿子耶罗波安作以色列王的时候，耶和华的话临到备利的儿子何西阿。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿的妻子和儿女"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华初次与何西阿说话，对他说：「你去娶淫妇为妻，也收那从淫乱所生的儿女；因为这地大行淫乱，离弃耶和华。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["于是，何西阿去娶了滴拉音的女儿歌篾。这妇人怀孕，给他生了一个儿子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华对何西阿说：「给他起名叫耶斯列；因为再过片时，我必讨耶户家在耶斯列杀人流血的罪，也必使以色列家的国灭绝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["到那日，我必在耶斯列平原折断以色列的弓。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["歌篾又怀孕生了一个女儿，耶和华对何西阿说：「给她起名叫罗·路哈玛",{"noteId":0},"；因为我必不再怜悯以色列家，决不赦免他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我却要怜悯犹大家，使他们靠耶和华—他们的 神得救，不使他们靠弓、刀、争战、马匹，与马兵得救。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["歌篾给罗·路哈玛断奶以后，又怀孕生了一个儿子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华说：「给他起名叫罗·阿米",{"noteId":1},"；因为你们不作我的子民，我也不作你们的 神。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列将要复兴"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["然而，以色列的人数必如海沙，不可量，不可数。从前在什么地方对他们说「你们不是我的子民」，将来在那里必对他们说「你们是永生 神的儿子」。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["犹大人和以色列人必一同聚集，为自己立一个首领，从这地上去",{"noteId":2},"，因为耶斯列的日子必为大日。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"就是不蒙怜悯的意思","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"就是非我民的意思","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或译：从被掳之地上来","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DAN/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}